's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Anti-Sustain Wall build for Terizla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/terizla#build-exp-anti-sustain-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Antique Cuirass\",\"text\":\"Purchase Antique Cuirass (2,170 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Anti-Sustain Wall build for Terizla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/terizla#build-exp-anti-sustain-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Anti-Sustain Wall build for Terizla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/terizla#build-exp-anti-sustain-wall\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/terizla\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":82,\"name\":\"Terizla\",\"slug\":\"terizla\",\"title\":\"Executioner\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\",\"Tank\"],\"specialty\":[\"Burst\",\"Crowd Control\"],\"lane\":[\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2019,\"stats\":{\"durability\":90,\"offense\":30,\"controlEffect\":40,\"difficulty\":20},\"winRate\":50.9,\"pickRate\":0.32,\"banRate\":0.17,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Terizla is strong against light melee fighters cause they'll have a hard time surviving his heavy skill damage, such as Zilong and Sun.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"sun\",\"heroName\":\"Sun\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Terizla is strong against light melee fighters cause they'll have a hard time surviving his heavy skill damage, such as Zilong and Sun.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"arlott\",\"heroName\":\"Arlott\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Terizla is countered by heroes with good Mobility or long attack range, because it will be diffcult to hit them with his skills. Such as Arlott and Lesley.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lesley\",\"heroName\":\"Lesley\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Terizla is countered by heroes with good Mobility or long attack range, because it will be diffcult to hit them with his skills. Such as Arlott and Lesley.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_2352b6ef3a86441e2a3880fa436df1de.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c4bb270c28c7be663f57e993b0d6d3d8.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"6\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_23a7a603ff9d20074777d52e2eb202f3.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Tigreal, Angela and Vale\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"23\",\"heroName\":\"Gord\",\"heroSlug\":\"gord\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_24b9fa9519483b3d2168261b0fb6c0cf.png\",\"tip\":\"Gord, Selena and Badang\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"79\",\"heroName\":\"Granger\",\"heroSlug\":\"granger\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_c7e48401ff0d33cb91ff1b4a59b3c0cf.png\",\"tip\":\"Granger, Kagura and Esmeralda\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Body of Smith\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Terizla gains 1% extra Damage Reduction (up to 20 (+1*Hero Level)%) for every 2.5% HP lost.\\nHe cannot gain extra Attack Speed and will convert every 1% extra Attack Speed into 1 Physical Attack.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terizla gains 1% extra Damage Reduction (up to 20 (+1*Hero Level)%) for every 2.5% HP lost.\\nHe cannot gain extra Attack Speed and will convert every 1% extra Attack Speed into 1 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Attack\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b08818fe1736239ae3be7cf2d2dabf08.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Revenge Strike\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Terizla strikes the ground with his hammer, sending a fissure forward that deals 300 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage. Upon hitting its first target, the fissure burrows into them, slowing them by 15%. Terizla also gains 15% Movement Speed for 3.5s.\\n\\nThe fissure then explodes, dealing 300 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) (+ 20% of the target's lost HP) Physical Damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terizla strikes the ground with his hammer, sending a fissure forward that deals 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Upon hitting its first target, the fissure burrows into them, slowing them by 15%. Terizla also gains 15% Movement Speed for 3.5s.\\n\\nThe fissure then explodes, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 20% of the target's lost HP) \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":\"8.5s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_75648daf275c81c11c68d0dc99ded14a.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Speed Up\"]},{\"name\":\"Execution Strike\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Terizla swings his hammer in a fan-shaped area ahead. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The first two attacks deal 90 (+135% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage each, while the third deals 225 (+220% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. Enemies hit will also be slowed by 20% for 1.25s (the Slowing Effect can stack).\\nDeals only 80% damage to Minions.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terizla swings his hammer in a fan-shaped area ahead. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The first two attacks deal 90\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+135% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" each, while the third deals 225\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+220% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Enemies hit will also be slowed by 20% for 1.25s (the Slowing Effect can stack).\\nDeals only 80% damage to Minions.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"9s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0edb37acc50cca6239a839bdb96fea5c.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Penalty Zone\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Terizla jumps to the designated area, dealing 300 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking enemies airborne for 0.6s. He then summons Scaffold and slows enemies by 25%. Scaffold will send out a hook at enemy heroes in range and pull them several times while dealing 150 (+30% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage each time.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Terizla jumps to the designated area, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and knocking enemies airborne for 0.6s. He then summons Scaffold and slows enemies by 25%. Scaffold will send out a hook at enemy heroes in range and pull them several times while dealing 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+30% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" each time.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"50s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_da9efd3bc3382173ceef6d14503894a2.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"gatotkaca\",\"heroName\":\"Gatotkaca\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Terizla works best with heroes who have strong initiation skills that allow him to deal more damage with his skills, heroes like Gatotkaca and Atlas are good examples here.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"atlas\",\"heroName\":\"Atlas\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Terizla works best with heroes who have strong initiation skills that allow him to deal more damage with his skills, heroes like Gatotkaca and Atlas are good examples here.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, Terizla can open with his Ultimate and his 1st Skill to control the enemy team, then use his 2nd Skill to repeatedly hit the targets pulled by the Scaffold.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8230,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_da9efd3bc3382173ceef6d14503894a2.png\"},{\"skillId\":8210,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_75648daf275c81c11c68d0dc99ded14a.png\"},{\"skillId\":8220,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0edb37acc50cca6239a839bdb96fea5c.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Terizla can use his 1st Skill to slow the enemy, then his 2nd Skill to repeatedly deal damage to them.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8210,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_75648daf275c81c11c68d0dc99ded14a.png\"},{\"skillId\":8220,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0edb37acc50cca6239a839bdb96fea5c.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Terizla build and counter guide for Mobile Legends. Learn the right EXP lane draft, War Axe timing, teamfight entry, and defense flexes that keep him useful.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Terizla is the EXP pick for drafts that need one body to start the fight, stay in the choke, and make the enemy carry hit through bad ground. He looks slow on paper, but the right game turns that slowness into control instead of a liability.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"terizla\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"exp-flicker-engage\",\"name\":\"EXP Flicker Engage\",\"roleContext\":\"EXP\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\",\"cost\":1820,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"fighter\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"firmness\",\"name\":\"Firmness\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/firmness.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"festival-of-blood\",\"name\":\"Festival of Blood\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/festival-of-blood.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light and Valor will decide the first two waves.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when burst magic can remove you before Queen's Wings and Body of Smith can stabilize the entry.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against repeated physical skill burst from fighters or assassins that must hit you before the carry is exposed.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when extra received healing and shielding matter more than Rose Gold Meteor's low-HP shield and hybrid defense.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default EXP setup for games where Terizla must create the first catch with Flicker plus Penalty Zone, then convert low-HP passives into a second hammer cycle.\",\"totalCost\":11000,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":65,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Rose Gold Meteor\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Queen's Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"attackspeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.attackSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Rose Gol