mith who was enslaved in the forges of the Abyss, forced to craft weapons for the demonic armies that destroyed his family. When he finally broke free, he took the greatest weapon he ever forged, a massive hammer of darkness, and swore to destroy every last forge of evil. His Body of Smith passive converts attack speed into raw power, making him slow but devastating. Terizla's Penalty Zone chains enemies to the ground, ensuring they face the full weight of his vengeance.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"jawhead\",\"heroName\":\"Jawhead\",\"relationship\":\"Mechanical warrior who shares his hatred of enslavement\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fredrinn\",\"heroName\":\"Fredrinn\",\"relationship\":\"Knight whose conviction matches his own\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"relationship\":\"Abyssal prince who commands the forces that enslaved him\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"thamuz\",\"heroName\":\"Thamuz\",\"relationship\":\"Demon lord whose forges he seeks to destroy\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Terizla\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":50.46,\"pickRate\":0.39,\"banRate\":0.28},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":50.48,\"pickRate\":0.38,\"banRate\":0.28},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":50.69,\"pickRate\":0.37,\"banRate\":0.25},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":50.51,\"pickRate\":0.33,\"banRate\":0.15},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":50.59,\"pickRate\":0.34,\"banRate\":0.16},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":50.76,\"pickRate\":0.32,\"banRate\":0.17},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":50.9,\"pickRate\":0.32,\"banRate\":0.17}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Terizla\",\"heroSlug\":\"terizla\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":1,\"winRate\":50.9,\"pickRate\":0.32,\"banRate\":0.17,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$60:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$60:props:tabData:counterData:countersThi