roes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Honor\"}}]]}]]}]\na4:[\"$\",\"article\",\"mythical_glory\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff5d73, #ff5d7333)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 12px -2px #ff5d7380\"}}],[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1 flex-wrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#ff5d73\",\"background\":\"#ff5d731a\",\"border\":\"1px solid #ff5d7340\"},\"children\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankCardH3\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Terizla\",\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=mythical_glory\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\",\"name\":\"Terizla\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"48.36\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Terizla\",\"delta\":\"-2.49%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.27\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.04\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]]}]]}]\na6:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Boots first, read the lobby honestly.\"}],\" \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/warrior-boots\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Warrior Boots\"}],\" are for physical-heavy lobbies and repeated basic-attack contact. \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/items/tough-boots\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Tough Boots\"}],\" are better whenever the fight is decided by chain control or persistent slows, because Terizla hates being held outside his second cast more than he hates taking one clean hit.\"]}]\na7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/queens-wings\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Queen's Wings\"}],\" is the default second or third slot.\"]}],\" If you are the first body in every fight, this is the item that lets the commit stay profitable.\"]}]\na8:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/dominance-ice\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Dominance Ice\"}],\" is for shield, regen, and clustered fights.\"]}],\" Buy it early into Esmeralda, sustain-heavy front lines, or gold laners who rely on healing to survive. Its Lifebane aura cuts enemy shields and HP regen to 60% of normal, Fortress Shield stacks Hybrid Defense for every enemy nearby, and both matter more than a greedier damage line in those games.\"]}]\na9:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/antique-cuirass\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Antique Cuirass\"}],\" is for physical skill burst.\"]}],\" If the problem is Nolan, Paquito, Benedetta, or another hero who chunks you before your passive and spell vamp stabilize the trade, this is the cleaner answer.\"]}]\naa:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/athenas-shield\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Athena's Shield\"}],\" is for front-loaded magic burst.\"]}],\" Lunox, Xavier, Pharsa, and similar mages are not scary because they poke forever. They are scary because the first hit decides whether you even get to stand in the fight. Athena's is for that exact moment.\"]}]\nab:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/oracle\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Oracle\"}],\" is the greedier sustain buy.\"]}],\" Take it when the enemy magic damage is repeated rather than explosive, or when your own draft keeps feeding you shields and healing over a long fight.\"]}]\nac:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/immortality\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Immortality\"}],\" is the late objective closer.\"]}],\" When one Lord fight decides the game, a second life is often worth more than squeezing one more offensive stat into a hero who already does his job with one damage item.\"]}]\nad:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/thunder-belt\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Thunder Belt\"}],\" is the scrappy-game flex.\"]}],\" Buy it when fights are long, messy, and decided by repeated contact rather than one burst window. It is not mandatory, but it is good in games where Terizla keeps walking at the same target again and again.\"]}]\nae:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The class to avoid is still attack-speed experimentation. Terizla converts attack speed into physical attack, but that does not magically make attack-speed items efficient. Buy items that help him hold ground, not items that pretend he is a marksman with a hammer.\"}]\naf:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Mistakes that lose Terizla games\"]}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Blind-picking him into reset lanes.\"}],\" Esmeralda and Guinevere are not annoying because they out-stat him. They are annoying because they keep turning honest trades into unfinished ones. If the lane is built around leaving your cone on reaction, the matchup is already asking the wrong question.\"]}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Dumping S2 from one spot like it is a canned animation.\"}],\" Execution Strike is a sequence, not a statue test. The time between the first and third swing is where good Terizla players win damage. If you do not move your feet, good opponents simply leave.\"]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-15\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Ulting first just because two targets lined up.\"}],\" Penalty Zone is strongest after the fight has already declared a direction. Throwing it early from bad angle or max range gives mobile heroes time to answer with Flicker, dash, or simple spacing. Terizla is often better as the second layer of engage than the desperate first one.\"]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-16\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Building extra damage when your team drafted you to be the wall.\"}],\" One real damage item is enough in most games. Every extra greed buy asks whether the enemy can burst you before the third hammer lands. If the answer is yes, you just deleted the reason Terizla was picked.\"]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-17\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Staying in side lane when Lord is the real clock.\"}],\" Once the map compresses around Lord or inhibitor fights, Terizla's value is in choke control and front-to-back fights. Catching one more side wave while your team gets forced 4v5 is how this hero loses without looking obviously wrong.\"]}]\nb5:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Key tips\"]}]\nb6:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Revenge Strike is better after the enemy spends movement. Make them show the dash first, then tag them and walk the cone where they have to go next.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb7:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-1\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Vengeance is not the default just because Terizla is tanky. It is best only when the enemy must stand and hit you. If your job is to create the catch, Flicker still gives him the cleaner game.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb8:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-2\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Penalty Zone gets stronger as the terrain gets tighter. Jungle mouths, Turtle ramps, and Lord entrances do more work for Terizla than open lane ever will.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb9:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-3\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Since the mana removal, there is no reason to ration your first full S2 cycle out of fear. Spend the wave clear, reach the river first, and make the enemy solve your rotation instead of the other way around.\"]}]]]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>